     "content": "\u010a\u010aFINALACTIONS:pick(mug1)place(mug1,\u0120inside_box)pick(mug3)place(mug3,\u0120inside_box)pick(spam)place(spam,\u0120cupboard_shelf)pick(sugar)place(sugar,\u0120cupboard_shelf)\u010a\u010aNO_ACTIONS",
